<section class="featured-system" aria-labelledby="job-radar-title">
  <header class="system-introduction">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">01 / FEATURED SYSTEM</p>
      <h2 id="job-radar-title">Job Radar</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="system-summary">
      <p class="system-problem">
        External job offers need a consistent structure before they can be compared, filtered and
        ranked.
      </p>
      <p>
        Job Radar collects external job offers, normalizes their data and removes duplicates by URL.
        The application exposes structured results through a FastAPI REST API with filtering and
        pagination, while deterministic scoring rules keep ranking behavior predictable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="system-explanation">
    <figure class="system-overview">
      <figcaption>
        <span class="section-label">SYSTEM OVERVIEW</span>
        <span class="overview-caption">Logical responsibilities, not execution order.</span>
      </figcaption>
      <p class="system-input">External offers</p>
      <dl class="system-stages">
        <div class="system-stage">
          <dt>Prepare</dt>
          <dd>ingestion</dd>
          <dd>normalization</dd>
          <dd>URL deduplication</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="system-stage">
          <dt>Persist</dt>
          <dd>PostgreSQL</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="system-stage">
          <dt>Serve</dt>
          <dd>REST API</dd>
          <dd>filtering</dd>
          <dd>pagination</dd>
          <dd>deterministic scoring</dd>
          <dd>frontend</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </figure>

    <dl class="system-notes">
      <div>
        <dt>URL IDENTITY</dt>
        <dd>Duplicate offers are identified through their source URL.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>DETERMINISTIC SCORING</dt>
        <dd>Defined scoring rules keep ranking behavior predictable and repeatable.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>ENGINEERING EVIDENCE</dt>
        <dd>OpenAPI documentation · pytest · GitHub Actions</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <footer class="system-footer">
